        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-28-t1917-040-on-the-theory-of-transformatio-audit-v2-thompson1917-t1917-040-9> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Thompson (1917) Ch. XVII whole-grid coordinate deformations — Dürer/Camper facial-profile shear & stretch group (geometric)" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 6.73e-01 .

